type: software
title: "PAARA Connector Audit Kit"
abstract: "An open, practitioner toolkit for auditing AI connectors before they are enabled in an enterprise. PAARA (Privacy-Aware AI Risk Architecture) treats the connector — OAuth / API permissions, Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers, and retrieval pipelines — as the unit of governance, and scores it with an explicit, reproducible seven-factor rule that yields a deployment decision. Ships a 20-test Python scanner, a coded audit of 13 public connectors, a connector audit checklist, and a connector DPIA template."
